{"ticker":"EXR","updated":"2026-10-30T22:47:45Z","profile":{"longName":"Extra Space Storage Inc.","shortName":"Extra Space Storage Inc","sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Industrial","country":"United States","website":"https://www.extraspace.com","fullTimeEmployees":8393,"marketCap":33396711424,"trailingPE":30.756098,"forwardPE":31.493507,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":9.4862175,"pegRatio":5.95,"targetMeanPrice":156.95,"targetHighPrice":178.0,"targetLowPrice":140.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.011,"earningsGrowth":0.498,"grossMargins":0.74889,"operatingMargins":0.44888002,"profitMargins":0.2953,"totalRevenue":3520550912,"beta":1.166,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":158.88,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":125.71,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.32},"summary":"Extra Space Storage Inc., headquartered in Salt Lake City, Utah, is a self-administered and self-managed REIT and a member of the S&P 500. As of June 30, 2026, the Company owned and/or operated 4,410 self-storage stores in 42 states and Washington, D.C. The Company's stores comprise approximately 3.0 million units and approximately 341.0 million square feet of rentable space operating under the Extra Space brand. The Company offers customers a wide selection of conveniently located and secure storage units across the country, including boat storage, RV storage, and business storage. It is the largest operator of self-storage properties in the United States. Extra Space Storage Inc. was incorporated in 1977 in Maryland, USA.","summary_zh":"Extra Space Storage Inc. 總部位於猶他州鹽湖城，是一家自行管理和自行管理的房地產投資信託基金，也是標準普爾 500 指數成員。截至 2026 年 6 月 30 日，該公司在 42 個州和華盛頓特區擁有和/或經營 4,410 家自助倉儲商店。該公司的商店包括約 300 萬個單位和約 3.41 億平方英尺的可出租經營空間屬於 Extra Space 品牌。該公司在全國範圍內為客戶提供多種位置便利且安全的存儲單元選擇，包括船舶存儲、房車存儲和商業存儲。它是美國最大的自助倉儲物業營運商。 Extra Space Storage Inc. 於 1977 年在美國馬裡蘭州成立。","sector_zh":"房地產","industry_zh":"房地產投資信託基金 - 工業","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":142.1,"h":142.63,"l":140.47,"c":140.8