UHNXaWl0VFI1ZzQ4ZHVrZHNCNE9kT3RpWmxhbGdwd25McTFZcDlLeEhSTHNjYklMcVpkZ2pUZXBfNEd6bjFfR0YwU0ZXc004cTFPWGx1MHRrOVFkZw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"額外空間儲存 (EXR) 2026 年第 3 季收益電話會議：提高 FFO 指導意見"},{"title":"[Extra Space Storage Q3 2026 Earnings Call] Extra Space Raises FFO Guidance to $8.45 as Same-Store Revenue Accelerates for Fifth Straight Quarter","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFByX0VON2t4dTI3MWZhZDdGLTZmWjEwbkVVQWVwazF6Q0dxV0lmVWVBU0VRc19faWRNR0hYRTBtTEJfUGQ3eG5hTDZ1bWt0VlhDdTkzNkhReU1vRi1k?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"[Extra Space Storage 2026 年第三季財報電話會議] 隨著同店營收連續第五個季度加速成長，Extra Space 將 FFO 指引提高至 8.45 美元"},{"title":"Earnings call transcript: Extra Space Storage posts Q3 2026 revenue beat","src":"Investing.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPdzFJdzJyMDU2cGFFaUVwX3BtU2xxT3Fld080Ulh3aTNfc3lyN3hGXzQxRWVpOW43VmMzdHVCdFNoQ3daLWJLTlM5dVNTVjFDVGlQNXhlNS11bk1QYXFVZ05mcVJMNTdpa2pZRFpaWjFlV3pPbXBRNHozdS15MTB4dlRTZlNXdU1XV0VmRjhRcXNlWTVjbGZ2Um1kQ2V1ZFpmZWd3YmFaQ2lkb0U4U2k2aUlSMEtmcDJxN2hlTlR6Y0d2dWtNTFE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"財報電話會議記錄：Extra Space Storage 2026 年第三季營收超出預期"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":13}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-20","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1289490/000128949026000011/exr-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Extra Space Storage Inc. (\"we,\" \"our,\" \"us\" or the \"Company\") is a fully integrated, self-administered and self-managed real estate investment trust (\"REIT\") formed as a Maryland corporation on April 30, 2004. We closed our initial public offering (\"IPO\") on August 17, 2004. Our common stock is traded on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol \"EXR.\"","zh":"Extra Space Storage Inc.（「我們」、「我們的」或「公司」）是一家完全一體化、自我管理和自我管理的房地產投資信託基金（「REIT」），於 2004 年 4 月 30 日作為馬裡蘭州公司成立。我們於 2004 年 8 月 17 日完成首次公開發行（「IPO」）。我們的普通股在紐約證券交易所交易，代號為「EXR」。"},{"en":"We were formed to continue the business of Extra Space Storage LLC and its subsidiaries, which had engaged in the self-storage business since 1977. These companies were reorganized after the consummation of our IPO and various formation transactions. Our executive management team and board of directors have extensive experience and ownership positions in the Company.","zh":"我們的成立是為了繼續 Extra Space Storage LLC 及其子公司的業務，這些公司自 1977 年以來一直從事自助倉儲業務。這些公司在我們完成 IPO 和各種組建交易後進行了重組。我們的執行管理團隊和董事會在公司擁有豐富的經驗和所有權職位。"},{"en":"Substantially all of our business is conducted through Extra Space Storage LP (the \"Operating Partnership\"). Our primary assets are general partner and limited partner interests in the Operating Partnership. This structure is commonly referred to as an umbrella partnership REIT, or UPREIT. We have elected to be taxed as a REIT under the Internal Revenue Code of 1986, as amended (the \"Internal Revenue Code\"). To the extent we continue to qualify as a REIT, we will not be subject to U.S. federal tax, with certain exceptions, on our REIT taxable income that is distributed to our stockholders.","zh":"我們的幾乎所有業務都是透過 Extra Space Storage LP（「營運合作夥伴」）進行的。我們的主要資產是普通合夥人和有限合夥人在營運合夥企業中的權益。這種結構通常被稱為傘式合夥 REIT 或 UPREIT。我們選擇根據經修訂的 1986 年《國內稅收法》（「《國內稅收法》」）作為 REIT 納稅。只要我們繼續符合房地產投資信託基金的資格，除某些例外情況外，我們將無需就分配給股東的房地產投資信託基金應稅收入繳納美國聯邦稅。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Self Storage Operations","val":2895190000,"zh":"自存儲操作"},{"name":"Tenant Reinsurance","val":352876000,"zh":"租戶再保險"}],"total":3377542000}},"peers":["PSA","MAA","ESS","CUBE","ARE"]}}